  {
   "blockType": "textSection",
   "blockName": "What These Services Receive",
   "heading": "What These Services Receive",
   "listWidth": "full",
   "justifyLastLine": "left",
   "body": {
    "root": {
     "type": "root",
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "version": 1,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "format": "justify",
       "indent": 0,
       "version": 1,
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Google Analytics.",
         "format": 1,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " If you accept analytics cookies, we use Google Analytics 4, a service of Google LLC, to understand how many people visit, which pages they read and how they reach us. When a page loads, Google Analytics receives the page address and title, the referring page, your browser and operating system, device type, screen size and language, together with the identifier in the _ga cookie. As you use the page, it also receives simple events, such as how far you scroll. It also receives your IP address, which Google uses to work out an approximate location (and, for visitors outside the European Union, the United Kingdom and Switzerland, to detect spam) and then discards. A daily copy of this data, including the _ga identifier, is exported to Google BigQuery, Google's data warehouse, where it is stored in Mumbai for our own reporting. Our Google Analytics account also shares this data with Google so that Google can improve its own products and services; for that data Google is an independent controller, and Google states in our settings that it will not use it for ad personalisation or ad targeting. This website sets no advertising cookies and is not linked to any advertising product, Google signals is switched off, and the website tells Google Analytics not to use your visit for ad personalisation. Google explains how it handles this information in ",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "link",
         "version": 3,
         "id": "7f82f775a7fbd5cfd219170f",
         "fields": {
          "linkType": "custom",
          "url": "https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites",
          "newTab": true
         },
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services",
           "format": 0,
           "style": "",
           "mode": "normal",
           "detail": 0,
           "version": 1,
           "$": {
            "color": "red"
           }
          }
         ],
         "direction": "ltr",
         "format": "",
         "indent": 0
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ".",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr",
       "textFormat": 0,
       "textStyle": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "format": "justify",
       "indent": 0,
       "version": 1,
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Google reCAPTCHA.",
         "format": 1,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The ",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "link",
         "version": 3,
         "id": "720a3e8be43c6f2a7b62e774",
         "fields": {
          "linkType": "custom",
          "url": "/book-an-appointment",
          "newTab": false
         },
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Book Your Appointment",
           "format": 0,
           "style": "",
           "mode": "normal",
           "detail": 0,
           "version": 1,
           "$": {
            "color": "red"
           }
          }
         ],
         "direction": "ltr",
         "format": "",
         "indent": 0
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " page uses reCAPTCHA to protect the booking form from spam and abuse. reCAPTCHA starts as soon as that page opens, and it runs on no other page. It collects device and browser information, your IP address and how you interact with the page. Google states that it processes this information on our behalf, only to provide this protection, and does not use it for other purposes such as personalised advertising. If the check is a barrier for you, write to ",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "link",
         "version": 3,
         "id": "d2f670186bc96482dc8bb3c2",
         "fields": {
          "linkType": "custom",
          "url": "mailto:info@momhindia.org",
          "newTab": false
         },
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "info@momhindia.org",
           "format": 0,
           "style": "",
           "mode": "normal",
           "detail": 0,
           "version": 1
          }
         ],
         "direction": "ltr",
         "format": "",
         "indent": 0
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " or call ",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "link",
         "version": 3,
         "id": "5cb4ee8f87bc5c493c8e8fbb",
         "fields": {
          "linkType": "custom",
          "url": "tel:+916377490417",
          "newTab": false
         },
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "+91 6377 490 417",
           "format": 0,
           "style": "",
           "mode": "normal",
           "detail": 0,
           "version": 1
          }
         ],
         "direction": "ltr",
         "format": "",
         "indent": 0
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " and we will book your visit by hand.",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr",
       "textFormat": 0,
       "textStyle": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "format": "justify",
       "indent": 0,
       "version": 1,
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Cookieless statistics.",
         "format": 1,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " We also use Vercel Web Analytics and Vercel Speed Insights, services of Vercel Inc., which hosts this website. They record page views and page-loading speed. They set no cookies on this website, and Vercel states that the data is not tied to any individual visitor or IP address.",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr",
       "textFormat": 0,
       "textStyle": ""
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "format": "justify",
       "indent": 0,
       "version": 1,
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Fonts.",
         "format": 1,
