         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " Playfair Display and some styles of Cormorant are delivered by Google Fonts; all other fonts on this website are served from our own website. Google states that Google Fonts sets no cookies, and that the IP address it receives with each font request is not used to build profiles or for advertising.",
         "format": 0,
